	<string>FIGHT connects to your Bluetooth heart rate monitor (chest strap, armband or watch in broadcast mode) to track live heart rate and beat-to-beat intervals.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothPeripheralUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FIGHT connects to your Bluetooth heart rate monitor.</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FIGHT checks which workouts it has already saved to Apple Health.</string>
